# Build context is the repo root (see docker-compose*.yml → dockerfile: docker/Dockerfile).
# The UI image only COPY-s web/ plus docker/nginx.conf and docker/entrypoint.sh.

# Exclude everything, then re-include only what the Dockerfile needs.
# `!docker/` opens the directory so specific files can be un-ignored; `docker/**`
# closes the rest of the tree (mock-api state, __pycache__, nginx.dev.conf, …).
**
!docker/
docker/**
!docker/Dockerfile
!docker/nginx.conf
!docker/entrypoint.sh
!web/
!web/**
